"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1401473535473589&title=%09We+see+the+effect+of+climate+change+every+day%E2%80%94in+more+extreme+weather%2C+rising+energy+costs%2C+and+growing+uncertainty+about+the+future.+Addressing+these+challenges+requires+practical%2C+forward-thinking+solutions+that+both+protect+our+environment+and+strengthen+our+infrastructure.+That+means+investing+in+clean%2C+renewable+energy+sources+like+solar%2C+which+can+lower+costs+for+families%2C+reduce+our+dependence+on+fossil+fuels%2C+and+create+good-paying+local+jobs.+It+also+means+modernizing+our+energy+grid%2C+supporting+energy+efficiency%2C+and+encouraging+responsible+development+that+preserves+our+natural+resources.+By+taking+a+balanced%2C+commonsense+approach%2C+we+can+build+a+more+sustainable+future+while+keeping+our+communities+affordable%2C+resilient%2C+and+economically+strong.%23Newtown+%23newtownct+Dave+Ackert+%23Conservation+%23climate+%23weather+%09%09"
